###Request
POST https://Testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/identitymicroservice/entra-otp-validation-success/OTP HTTP/1.11

###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "tokenType": "Bearer",
  "scope": "openid profile",
  "accessToken": "access-token",
  "refreshToken": "refresh-token",
  "idToken": "id-token",
  "continuationToken": "success-continuation-token",
  "expiresIn": 3600
}

